---
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<section id="no-money-down" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-ink text-white" aria-labelledby="no-money-down-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <div data-reveal="fade-up">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-amber font-bold">
          Solar without the upfront hit
        </p>
        <h2
          id="no-money-down-heading"
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold mt-4 leading-tight"
        >
          Go solar with no money down.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/75 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          Our program does not require one penny out of pocket. Instead of adding a
          new bill to your budget, we help redirect what you are already spending
          with the utility company and use it to move your home to solar.
        </p>
        <figure class="mt-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-2xl">
          <img
            src="/solar-vs-utility-comparison.png"
            alt="Comparison showing going solar and owning your home building equity versus paying the utility company or renting an apartment"
            class="w-full h-auto"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption class="px-5 py-4 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-white/80">
            Owning your power works like owning your home. Paying the utility is
            more like renting.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white text-ink rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-2xl"
        data-reveal="fade-up"
        style="--reveal-delay: 140ms;"
      >
        <p class="text-[4.5rem] sm:text-[6rem] leading-none font-semibold text-amber tracking-tight">
          $0
        </p>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight">
          Most homeowners start by replacing what they already pay.
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          In many cases, the solar payment is less than the current utility bill.
          Great Lakes Solar walks you through the numbers before you decide.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center bg-amber text-ink rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-bold hover:bg-amber/90 transition-colors"
          >
            See If You Qualify
          </a>
          <a
            href={site.phoneHref}
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center border border-ink/15 rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-bold hover:bg-sand transition-colors"
          >
            {site.phoneDisplay}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
